g9w|n|A function involving the coefficients and the variables of a quantic, and such that when the quantic is lineally transformed the same function of the new variables and coefficients shall be equal to the old function multiplied by a factor. An invariant is a like function involving only the coefficients of the quantic.	N:oq3,114,4;21tb,82,3~oq3,114,4;21tb,82,3
